    "show_share": true,
    "description": "As part of the Foundations for Health and Empowerment project, a joint venture of the Aga Khan Foundation, Canada, and Aga Khan Foundation, Kyrgyzstan, nine nurses and midwives from Kyrgyzstan visited the Aga Khan University School of Nursing and Midwifery, AKU-SONAM, for a three-month capacity-building program led by the School's outreach and policy unit.",
